  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "Korean Real-Time Data Base (RTDB) for NEAR-GOOS",
  "description": "The NEAR-GOOS real-time database of Korea provides real-time oceanographic and meteorology data including water temperature, wave height, wave pressure, wind speed, wind direction, air temperature, humidity, and air pressure. Data are obtained from coastal stations: Sokcho, Wangdo, Kwangan, Kyobon, Chulwoon, Seocheon, Taean, Incheon, Boksacho, Donongtan (Marado), Donghae gasfield, Ieodo, and Banseo.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: To offer basic data service to NEAR-GOOS and GOOS communities as part of the NEAR-GOOS project.",
  "url": "https://zenodo.org/records/23569335",
